# === GAF knowledge system runtime files (v8.3.1 / M0) ===
# - 运行时 session active 文件 (gaf_init.sh 每次跑会 create) — 在 .trash/ 下
# - sync-state.json (sync_ai_memory 临时状态)
# - .ai-memory/evidence/ 是 AI 反思飞轮数据, **必须 commit** (N97 修复 v8.4)
#   - _templates/ 模板 (本仓库源)
#   - YYYY-MM-DD/<task>/_template_*.md 已填 evidence (本仓库源, 飞轮学习用)
#   - YYYY-MM-DD/_session_*.md 会话摘要 (本仓库源, 跨会话记忆)
#   - 任何未填的 _template_*.md (placeholder/TODO) → commit 时 reject
sync-state.json
.ai-memory/.sync.lock
# TD-332/TD-344/TD-347/TD-348 (spec-2026-07-26-governance-batch-perf-cache + TD-348): mtime-based cache
.ai-memory/.sync-cache.json
.ai-memory/.schema-unification-cache.json
.ai-memory/.docs-index-cache.json
.ai-memory/.doc-path-drift-cache.json
.ai-memory/.path-consistency-cache.json
# B1 治本机制 (2026-07-16): step checkpoint 运行时文件, 不 commit (保留 .gitkeep)
.ai-memory/session/*.json

# M2 (2026-08-16): claimed-rules activation receipt (post-commit hook 每次 commit 后自动追记, 运行时产物不 commit)
.ai-memory/ops/claimed-activation.md

.ruff_cache/

# === .trash/ 临时文件暂存区 (N125) ===
# - AI 对话期间产生的临时脚本 (_temp_*.py / _commit_msg.txt 等) 放此目录
# - 不追踪 git, 对话所有任务结束后统一删除
# - .trash/manifest.md 记录每个文件的用途和预计清理时间 (也忽略)
.trash/

# GAF audit / hook logs (local only, do not commit)
.gaf_audit.log
.pre-commit-hooks.log

# Agent session working documents (auto-generated per session, not project artifacts)
.trae/documents/

# === IDE skill/rules junctions (v9.4 multi-IDE) ===
# 权威源: .skills/ (skills|rules 三兄弟), 已进 git
# .trae/skills|rules 和 .opencode/skills|rules 均为 junction -> .skills/, 不重复入库
.trae/skills/
.trae/rules/
.opencode/

# Runtime PID files (auto-generated by gaf_services.ps1)
.gaf_pids/

# RAG / ChromaDB persistent index (runtime data, not source code)
backend/data/
